# GAME on via FUNCTION+SYSTEM (43+46, hold 0, tap 18 = &tog 3), then all 2 press orders x 2 release orders; Q position probes GAME+, SYMBOL, FUNCTION (F1), then base; the same path toggles GAME off. Esc (GAME) vs Tab (QWERTY) at position 0 proves the mode.
s/.*hid_listener_keycode/kp/p
/^SIM_SOFT_OFF$/p
